(1978487, 272350, 18191, '<td valign="top">w00t! it''s me!<br/> <br/>Lovely sunset tones and silhouette. It''s a beautiful piece. My only criticism is that it really lacks a central focal point. I don''t know if it is the mountain or the cranes or what. Just some criticism.<br/> <br/>A great capture nonetheless. and i actually think the border is conservative and rather fitting.</td>', 'w00t! it''s me! Lovely sunset tones and silhouette. It''s a beautiful piece. My only criticism is that it really lacks a central focal point. I don''t know if it is the mountain or the cranes or what. Just some criticism. A great capture nonetheless. and i actually think the border is conservative and rather fitting.', '2005-12-26 08:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
