(1978533, 272421, 24073, '<td valign="top">Alright I have to comment on this photo.  I just went back over this photo with my wife, and I was telling her how it has completely grown on me.  I have already bumped this thing up twice, from a 6 to a 7, and then to an 8 now.  I love its composition, there are just a couple technicals that need to be worked out, I wont mention them, because Im sure you already know, and besides that I dont want to take away from how much I adore this shot.  GJ, and GL.</td>', 'Alright I have to comment on this photo.  I just went back over this photo with my wife, and I was telling her how it has completely grown on me.  I have already bumped this thing up twice, from a 6 to a 7, and then to an 8 now.  I love its composition, there are just a couple technicals that need to be worked out, I wont mention them, because Im sure you already know, and besides that I dont want to take away from how much I adore this shot.  GJ, and GL.', '2005-12-26 09:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
