(1979566, 271073, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  Good username capture, as difficult as this may have been.  Colors are nice, especially in the eye.  Criticism; difficult, as this is likely ''opportune'', but a slightly different angle, gaining more ''wackybill'', and even more detail on it, and that eye, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Also 640 would have helped you.  Fairly good control of the whites, especially with such a dark background and likely trying to ''tweak'' that wackybill.</td>', '7 - Good.  Good username capture, as difficult as this may have been.  Colors are nice, especially in the eye.  Criticism; difficult, as this is likely ''opportune'', but a slightly different angle, gaining more ''wackybill'', and even more detail on it, and that eye, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Also 640 would have helped you.  Fairly good control of the whites, especially with such a dark background and likely trying to ''tweak'' that wackybill.', '2005-12-26 19:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1979567, 272313, 47117, '<td valign="top">Straight and to the point! Nice colors!</td>', 'Straight and to the point! Nice colors!', '2005-12-26 19:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1979569, 272182, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great photograph!  Look''s like it racing through the night in its heyday.</td>', 'Great photograph!  Look''s like it racing through the night in its heyday.', '2005-12-26 19:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1979570, 272629, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  Like the way you pulled it apart and chopped some up to ''showcase''.  Criticism; a little ''blown'' in my opinion, although I realize you may have been going for a ''high key'' effect.  Just more detail in the textures and ''sliced garlic'', would have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Good.  Like the way you pulled it apart and chopped some up to ''showcase''.  Criticism; a little ''blown'' in my opinion, although I realize you may have been going for a ''high key'' effect.  Just more detail in the textures and ''sliced garlic'', would have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-12-26 19:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
