(1979696, 271707, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good macro.  Criticism; difficult, to really nit-pick, the glare on the eyes (almost unavoidable), the slight ''blowing'' of the grass/leaf it is on and the focus/detail ''fading'' down the ''body''.  Opportunity capture, natural lighting, etc, make it very difficult likely to adjust/modify any of these ''issues''.  A tweaking of the colors perhaps, to try to get the red/green contrasting/vivid more, who knows.  Good fit for username.  Good capture.  Like the composition and 640x640.</td>', '8 - Very good macro.  Criticism; difficult, to really nit-pick, the glare on the eyes (almost unavoidable), the slight ''blowing'' of the grass/leaf it is on and the focus/detail ''fading'' down the ''body''.  Opportunity capture, natural lighting, etc, make it very difficult likely to adjust/modify any of these ''issues''.  A tweaking of the colors perhaps, to try to get the red/green contrasting/vivid more, who knows.  Good fit for username.  Good capture.  Like the composition and 640x640.', '2005-12-26 19:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1979703, 272371, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Excellent capture.  Good fit for username.  Criticism; not much, maybe 640 height too, but you might lose the ''sailing/horizontal'' effect, so not sure.  Nice colors, especially the whites/grays/silvers.  To really nit-pick, perhaps a fraction more detail in the wings/feathers/texture, but difficult, and obviously an opportune capture. Like the water drop(s) capture.   I am sure this size doesn''t do the quality in this justice.  Up to 9 from 8.</td>', '9 - Excellent capture.  Good fit for username.  Criticism; not much, maybe 640 height too, but you might lose the ''sailing/horizontal'' effect, so not sure.  Nice colors, especially the whites/grays/silvers.  To really nit-pick, perhaps a fraction more detail in the wings/feathers/texture, but difficult, and obviously an opportune capture. Like the water drop(s) capture.   I am sure this size doesn''t do the quality in this justice.  Up to 9 from 8.', '2005-12-26 20:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1979704, 272311, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Simplicity.  Looks like a Eucalypt.  Good texture and color capture.  Criticism; whilst the frame ''works'', and the color is quite complementary, I think I''d have rather seen this ''bigger/wider'', at the ''cost'' of the frame.  Perhaps even more height just for added impact, especially ''here'', not sure.  Very nice, and good depth of field.  Perhaps a fraction more detail/focal area in the uppermost leaves, may have made this even better.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Simplicity.  Looks like a Eucalypt.  Good texture and color capture.  Criticism; whilst the frame ''works'', and the color is quite complementary, I think I''d have rather seen this ''bigger/wider'', at the ''cost'' of the frame.  Perhaps even more height just for added impact, especially ''here'', not sure.  Very nice, and good depth of field.  Perhaps a fraction more detail/focal area in the uppermost leaves, may have made this even better.', '2005-12-26 20:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
