(1980712, 272371, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice, great image quality for sure, I gave it an 6.  However, this isn´t a particularly interesting shot for me as I have seen so many other like it, needs something extra for me to go "wow".</td>', 'Pretty nice, great image quality for sure, I gave it an 6.  However, this isn´t a particularly interesting shot for me as I have seen so many other like it, needs something extra for me to go "wow".', '2005-12-27 08:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980715, 272450, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad take on the challenge but I would go easy on the saturation next time you shoot something so red, the red channel is blown out in several places and frankly it isn´t very flattering.</td>', 'Not a bad take on the challenge but I would go easy on the saturation next time you shoot something so red, the red channel is blown out in several places and frankly it isn´t very flattering.', '2005-12-27 08:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980717, 272494, 21714, '<td valign="top">Outstanding work. Perfect.</td>', 'Outstanding work. Perfect.', '2005-12-27 08:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980718, 272148, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cute expression but there are two things that make this shot pretty mediocre IMHO while it could have been great.  1.  I dislike that the focus is on the mouth and not the eyes, also the eyes look somehow unnatural, did you do some spot editing on just the eyes?  2.  The backround is just too dark for my taste, would much rather have seen something resembling his/her natural habitat as a backround.  Other than that, pretty good.</td>', 'Cute expression but there are two things that make this shot pretty mediocre IMHO while it could have been great.  1.  I dislike that the focus is on the mouth and not the eyes, also the eyes look somehow unnatural, did you do some spot editing on just the eyes?  2.  The backround is just too dark for my taste, would much rather have seen something resembling his/her natural habitat as a backround.  Other than that, pretty good.', '2005-12-27 08:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980722, 272311, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nice, would have been perfect for the shallow dof too.  Love the simplicity and DOF along with the image quality.  8 from me.</td>', 'Wow, very nice, would have been perfect for the shallow dof too.  Love the simplicity and DOF along with the image quality.  8 from me.', '2005-12-27 08:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980724, 272186, 27482, '<td valign="top">Funny! :D  Only to nitpick though I would have liked this image even more if the whole bread would have been in the shot...</td>', 'Funny! :D  Only to nitpick though I would have liked this image even more if the whole bread would have been in the shot...', '2005-12-27 08:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
