(1985783, 272421, 15711, '<td valign="top">The fuschia collar is a nice single color in this one. Great patterns on the wall and the dog''s neck and back. I wish I could see the eyes just a little with a glint.</td>', 'The fuschia collar is a nice single color in this one. Great patterns on the wall and the dog''s neck and back. I wish I could see the eyes just a little with a glint.', '2005-12-29 09:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985786, 272221, 15711, '<td valign="top">I can see Ingrid Bergman stepping off of the train in an old 40''s movie! I like the nostalgia that the filter evokes. The mist in the background is perfect.</td>', 'I can see Ingrid Bergman stepping off of the train in an old 40''s movie! I like the nostalgia that the filter evokes. The mist in the background is perfect.', '2005-12-29 09:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985787, 271508, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I like the tilt of the flower and it''s reflection. The silvery tones of the water make it appear to be an undulating mirror.  Nice! 8</td>', 'Very pretty. I like the tilt of the flower and it''s reflection. The silvery tones of the water make it appear to be an undulating mirror.  Nice! 8', '2005-12-29 09:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985795, 272350, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice depiction with the 4 distinct colors going from dark to light!!</td>', 'Nice depiction with the 4 distinct colors going from dark to light!!', '2005-12-29 09:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985797, 272148, 15711, '<td valign="top">The eyes seem slightly out of focus. The detailing on the face is good. Makes me think of Roddy McDowell in "Planet of the Apes."</td>', 'The eyes seem slightly out of focus. The detailing on the face is good. Makes me think of Roddy McDowell in "Planet of the Apes."', '2005-12-29 09:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985799, 271073, 15711, '<td valign="top">Poor bird!!! The lighting seems just a touch harsh. I do like the use of negative space to draw attention to the bill.</td>', 'Poor bird!!! The lighting seems just a touch harsh. I do like the use of negative space to draw attention to the bill.', '2005-12-29 09:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985802, 271843, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - I don''t see carnations and lilies as fungus but I do see the one mushroom. This is still a fun take on the challenge. I''d maximize my size by using the full 640 pixels allowed, so that we could see more detail.</td>', 'HEE HEE - I don''t see carnations and lilies as fungus but I do see the one mushroom. This is still a fun take on the challenge. I''d maximize my size by using the full 640 pixels allowed, so that we could see more detail.', '2005-12-29 09:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985805, 271492, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry of the spacing of the windows and doors that are broken up by their variables (ie: different glass, stairs, curtains, etc).</td>', 'I like the symmetry of the spacing of the windows and doors that are broken up by their variables (ie: different glass, stairs, curtains, etc).', '2005-12-29 09:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985806, 272613, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s the most livid rose eater I''ve ever seen. ha ha ha ha<br/> <br/>I like the saturation of color and the imaginative take.  Nice detailing too.</td>', 'That''s the most livid rose eater I''ve ever seen. ha ha ha ha I like the saturation of color and the imaginative take.  Nice detailing too.', '2005-12-29 09:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985807, 271732, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty setting. I wish that there were more emphasis on the school but with the lighting as it is, you are drawn behind it to the mountain instead.  Black and white certainly evokes a days gone by era feeling.</td>', 'Pretty setting. I wish that there were more emphasis on the school but with the lighting as it is, you are drawn behind it to the mountain instead.  Black and white certainly evokes a days gone by era feeling.', '2005-12-29 09:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985809, 272628, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great close up but he seems ever so slightly out of focus.  Darling bird and the colors are good.</td>', 'Great close up but he seems ever so slightly out of focus.  Darling bird and the colors are good.', '2005-12-29 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985820, 272403, 15711, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like somebody bundles up with a fur hat and  coat. Nice detail and the DOF is really well done.</td>', 'Almost looks like somebody bundles up with a fur hat and  coat. Nice detail and the DOF is really well done.', '2005-12-29 09:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985823, 272337, 15711, '<td valign="top">I had a poster of a similar shot and had it on the wall for years.  Very serene. I wish there were more of the reflection of the trees in the water so we could see the complete reverse of the landscape. Lovely colors.</td>', 'I had a poster of a similar shot and had it on the wall for years.  Very serene. I wish there were more of the reflection of the trees in the water so we could see the complete reverse of the landscape. Lovely colors.', '2005-12-29 09:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985826, 272525, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool, but the bottom of the jet is chopped off and I feel like I''m missing something. I like the lighting and the dots of stars in the sky. Maybe more negative space to one side and the plane less centered would be more visually appealing.</td>', 'Pretty cool, but the bottom of the jet is chopped off and I feel like I''m missing something. I like the lighting and the dots of stars in the sky. Maybe more negative space to one side and the plane less centered would be more visually appealing.', '2005-12-29 09:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985827, 272158, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - somebody has a vast collection of rubber ducks.  Great clarity and I love the superman capes.  Really cute.</td>', 'HEE HEE - somebody has a vast collection of rubber ducks.  Great clarity and I love the superman capes.  Really cute.', '2005-12-29 09:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985832, 272598, 15711, '<td valign="top">Suites the challenge and the frame is nice.  I do wish that the image weren''t so blurred. I''d like to see the cross more focused and the blackground blurred. Still, it''s impactful and quite artsy.</td>', 'Suites the challenge and the frame is nice.  I do wish that the image weren''t so blurred. I''d like to see the cross more focused and the blackground blurred. Still, it''s impactful and quite artsy.', '2005-12-29 09:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985834, 272261, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is pretty darn funny. I love the DOF. His expression is hilarious. If somebody''s name were MountainMan, that would fit as well. ha ha ha ha ha ha</td>', 'This is pretty darn funny. I love the DOF. His expression is hilarious. If somebody''s name were MountainMan, that would fit as well. ha ha ha ha ha ha', '2005-12-29 09:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985837, 271682, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting and the leading line is well done. Great DOF.</td>', 'This is really interesting and the leading line is well done. Great DOF.', '2005-12-29 09:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985839, 271663, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice detailing on the eyes. Almost has human qualities. Something seems slightly out of focus on the face. Still, an emotive capture.</td>', 'Nice detailing on the eyes. Almost has human qualities. Something seems slightly out of focus on the face. Still, an emotive capture.', '2005-12-29 09:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985841, 271813, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - a literal take - I like it. The focus is tack sharp and the reflective quality just duplicates the impact of the camera and razor blade.</td>', 'HEE HEE - a literal take - I like it. The focus is tack sharp and the reflective quality just duplicates the impact of the camera and razor blade.', '2005-12-29 09:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985845, 272633, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very graphic and abstract. Looks like maybe those are paper clips????</td>', 'Very graphic and abstract. Looks like maybe those are paper clips????', '2005-12-29 09:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985850, 272228, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the hair and the profile, but the green just sort of ruins this for me. It''s distracting and the texture is a tad weird.  She is lovely and I''d love it if maybe she were wearing black and just faded into the background, or had on a thinly strapped top or even a towel that we didn''t see, so there could be some detail on her neck and collar bones. She doesn''t really appear to be a red head, but that''s a minor nit pick at this point. 7</td>', 'I like the hair and the profile, but the green just sort of ruins this for me. It''s distracting and the texture is a tad weird.  She is lovely and I''d love it if maybe she were wearing black and just faded into the background, or had on a thinly strapped top or even a towel that we didn''t see, so there could be some detail on her neck and collar bones. She doesn''t really appear to be a red head, but that''s a minor nit pick at this point. 7', '2005-12-29 09:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1985851, 271963, 15711, '<td valign="top">You can''t get more graphic than that!! Reminds me of the first day of school and my new box of crayons!!!</td>', 'You can''t get more graphic than that!! Reminds me of the first day of school and my new box of crayons!!!', '2005-12-29 09:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
