(1987248, 272088, 37544, '<td valign="top">OMG you''re kidding? That is what a tee is? I had no idea! Thank you for clearing that up. J/K LOL I am sure that most people know what a tee is. I didn''t think that a definition was needed. I like how you chose to use one black tee. It singles it out from the rest. I think that a different angle would have been more interesting however.</td>', 'OMG you''re kidding? That is what a tee is? I had no idea! Thank you for clearing that up. J/K LOL I am sure that most people know what a tee is. I didn''t think that a definition was needed. I like how you chose to use one black tee. It singles it out from the rest. I think that a different angle would have been more interesting however.', '2005-12-29 22:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
