(1987368, 272629, 38032, '<td valign="top">i love this image as almost as much as i love garlic: 8</td>', 'i love this image as almost as much as i love garlic: 8', '2005-12-29 22:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1987418, 272447, 38032, '<td valign="top">This image is absolutely beautiful ... it does, however, suffer from confusing light sources and too much noise (the tree in the forground looks like either a flash or car lights are on it - if the moon were the only llight source it might be more effective).Allowing the camera to sit on a tri-pod and keeping a low ISO would give better results (I''m making assumptions of course about the way it was shot -but I''m just trying to help.  Good luck.</td>', 'This image is absolutely beautiful ... it does, however, suffer from confusing light sources and too much noise (the tree in the forground looks like either a flash or car lights are on it - if the moon were the only llight source it might be more effective).Allowing the camera to sit on a tri-pod and keeping a low ISO would give better results (I''m making assumptions of course about the way it was shot -but I''m just trying to help.  Good luck.', '2005-12-29 22:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
