(1988701, 271963, 48928, '<td valign="top">After coming back to this I have changed my mind and am bumping it up to a 7.  At first the shot just seemed too easy...but I highly doubt I could make a crayon look that cool so GOOD job.</td>', 'After coming back to this I have changed my mind and am bumping it up to a 7.  At first the shot just seemed too easy...but I highly doubt I could make a crayon look that cool so GOOD job.', '2005-12-30 15:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
