(1990965, 272322, 17507, '<td valign="top">there is at least one other that chose this username, but you''re the only one who actually used the 8699! congratulations to you for doing that; I really appreciate it when someone actually pays attention to what they''re doing! I don''t particularly like this photograph, but your attention to detail pleases me so much that I''m giving you an 8 anyway!</td>', 'there is at least one other that chose this username, but you''re the only one who actually used the 8699! congratulations to you for doing that; I really appreciate it when someone actually pays attention to what they''re doing! I don''t particularly like this photograph, but your attention to detail pleases me so much that I''m giving you an 8 anyway!', '2005-12-31 18:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1990966, 271678, 17507, '<td valign="top">awesome amoeba. I like how you included the dark spots to simulate... oh what are they... the nucleus and vacuole? good thing I''m not a biologist cuz I don''t remember the terminology... if you could have kept the stars in focus, I think this would be even better.</td>', 'awesome amoeba. I like how you included the dark spots to simulate... oh what are they... the nucleus and vacuole? good thing I''m not a biologist cuz I don''t remember the terminology... if you could have kept the stars in focus, I think this would be even better.', '2005-12-31 18:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
