(1993446, 271488, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Up from 7.  The colors are very nice in this, as is the composition and also the pose.  Criticism; my first thoughts on viewing this (and still are to some extent) are that this has more of a Korean (or ''other'' Asian) type of ''style'', than Japanese, but apologies if wrong.  Looks slightly ''over neat-imaged'' (again apologies if wrong), but ''works'' nevertheless.  Overall though, a very nice photograph. edit:typos<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-02 06:07:46.</i></td>', '8 - Up from 7.  The colors are very nice in this, as is the composition and also the pose.  Criticism; my first thoughts on viewing this (and still are to some extent) are that this has more of a Korean (or ''other'' Asian) type of ''style'', than Japanese, but apologies if wrong.  Looks slightly ''over neat-imaged'' (again apologies if wrong), but ''works'' nevertheless.  Overall though, a very nice photograph. edit:typos', '2006-01-01 22:20:44.000000', '2006-01-02 06:07:46.000000', 1),
(1993451, 271660, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Very good.  Like the big size.  Good username capture.  Criticism; not much, to really nit-pick, maybe a slight variation in the crop at the top, but minor.  Perhaps a little more detail on the fore rock (including the ''overhang''), but likely difficult.  Hard to discern with this view, but the horizon may need a slight nudge up on the left, but apologies if wrong - the shadows are nice in the fore, but if they and the colors could be emphasized just slightly (if possible), may have made this even better in my opinion.  I think I have to take this up to 9 from 8.</td>', '9 - Very good.  Like the big size.  Good username capture.  Criticism; not much, to really nit-pick, maybe a slight variation in the crop at the top, but minor.  Perhaps a little more detail on the fore rock (including the ''overhang''), but likely difficult.  Hard to discern with this view, but the horizon may need a slight nudge up on the left, but apologies if wrong - the shadows are nice in the fore, but if they and the colors could be emphasized just slightly (if possible), may have made this even better in my opinion.  I think I have to take this up to 9 from 8.', '2006-01-01 22:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1993453, 272061, 40819, '<td valign="top">Very nice image</td>', 'Very nice image', '2006-01-01 22:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1993458, 272602, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good angle.  Nice colors.  Criticism; your call, but if this were cropped tighter and perhaps just the starfish and water, making a more ''simple'' composition, likely make this better (and the starfish pop more) in my opinion.  Perhaps even just a little less sky, as the color is nice there too, not sure.  More ''dominance'' of the starfish likely also would have helped, especially for the Challenge.  Nice as is, apart from the dark areas bottom left and right.  Overall just seems a little ''dark''.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - Good angle.  Nice colors.  Criticism; your call, but if this were cropped tighter and perhaps just the starfish and water, making a more ''simple'' composition, likely make this better (and the starfish pop more) in my opinion.  Perhaps even just a little less sky, as the color is nice there too, not sure.  More ''dominance'' of the starfish likely also would have helped, especially for the Challenge.  Nice as is, apart from the dark areas bottom left and right.  Overall just seems a little ''dark''.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2006-01-01 22:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1993461, 272628, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  Nice color and composition.  Like the snow/ice on the ground as an added element here.  Criticism; difficult, as opportunity doesn''t wait long (if indeed it was there at all), but ''if only'' you got it ''taking a step''.  Seems a little ''soft'', whether that is focus or ''neat image'' not sure, either way good capture.  Just seems the snow/ice is slightlysharper, but difficult to discern at this size.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Very good.  Nice color and composition.  Like the snow/ice on the ground as an added element here.  Criticism; difficult, as opportunity doesn''t wait long (if indeed it was there at all), but ''if only'' you got it ''taking a step''.  Seems a little ''soft'', whether that is focus or ''neat image'' not sure, either way good capture.  Just seems the snow/ice is slightlysharper, but difficult to discern at this size.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2006-01-01 22:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1993462, 271608, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  Criticism; a little dark in my opinion, but I realize that is the style you were going for.  Good capture of the username.  Nice setting and angle.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Very good.  Criticism; a little dark in my opinion, but I realize that is the style you were going for.  Good capture of the username.  Nice setting and angle.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2006-01-01 22:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1993464, 272253, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  Hope you get a smile from this.  Criticism; only the bottom ''cut'' really, but likely done the best with what you had.  Like the straw ''element'', good eye capture.  Perhaps if the nose and eyes were a little sharper, but not sure, and don''t know if the ''4paws'' would have gained the same focus in doing so.   Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Very good.  Hope you get a smile from this.  Criticism; only the bottom ''cut'' really, but likely done the best with what you had.  Like the straw ''element'', good eye capture.  Perhaps if the nose and eyes were a little sharper, but not sure, and don''t know if the ''4paws'' would have gained the same focus in doing so.   Up to 8 from 7.', '2006-01-01 22:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1993466, 272399, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Wild or not.  The toning works well here, although I presume the color looks just as nice, especially with the seemingly ''simple'' background.  The capture of the wings slightly raised is good.  Criticism; difficult, but mainly wish it were 640.  Perhaps a few ''blown'' issues, but difficult to discern at this size.  Maybe the color would have been better, who knows, but your call at any rate. Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Wild or not.  The toning works well here, although I presume the color looks just as nice, especially with the seemingly ''simple'' background.  The capture of the wings slightly raised is good.  Criticism; difficult, but mainly wish it were 640.  Perhaps a few ''blown'' issues, but difficult to discern at this size.  Maybe the color would have been better, who knows, but your call at any rate. Up to 8 from 7.', '2006-01-01 22:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1993467, 272061, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - This is very nice, really like the colors.  Background is nice and simple and ''pure''.  Criticism; difficult, especially seeing as this is likely ''opportune'', but sharper, but you likely know that, especially on the face.  A little lighter too, as is on the tail/wing, make this better in my opinion.  Difficult to adjust the lighting/contrast, especially seeing as the ''rear end'' looks like it is starting to ''go'' as is.  Good capture though.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - This is very nice, really like the colors.  Background is nice and simple and ''pure''.  Criticism; difficult, especially seeing as this is likely ''opportune'', but sharper, but you likely know that, especially on the face.  A little lighter too, as is on the tail/wing, make this better in my opinion.  Difficult to adjust the lighting/contrast, especially seeing as the ''rear end'' looks like it is starting to ''go'' as is.  Good capture though.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2006-01-01 22:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1993468, 272625, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice macro, seems ''natural'' (no make up, neat image, etc), good ''feel''/detail in the skin and lashes.  Nice coloring.  I like the seemingly ''thoughtful capture'' in the eye.  Criticism; difficult, but perhaps a little sharper focus on the iris/eye, but the detail in the lashes/brow/hair is good.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop on the right, even though it adds ''context''/perspective, still may have made the ''features'' pop just a little more.  Thank you for doing a ''quality shot'' of my ''username''.  Up to 7 from 6.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - Nice macro, seems ''natural'' (no make up, neat image, etc), good ''feel''/detail in the skin and lashes.  Nice coloring.  I like the seemingly ''thoughtful capture'' in the eye.  Criticism; difficult, but perhaps a little sharper focus on the iris/eye, but the detail in the lashes/brow/hair is good.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop on the right, even though it adds ''context''/perspective, still may have made the ''features'' pop just a little more.  Thank you for doing a ''quality shot'' of my ''username''.  Up to 7 from 6.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2006-01-01 22:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
