(1994077, 272319, 30222, '<td valign="top">sorry to have confused all you folks but this image was not meant as an entry for this challenge<br/>the xx is just a worktitle and i just parked the image there to see what it looks like (lack of space in my portofolio)<br/>this happened to me twice lately im afraid to say<br/>i have tried to get it undone the entry but they could or would not let me do so<br/>or at least give it a title (bark: cause that is what it is<br/>and there is a user with this name i found out) but this plan didnt work out either for some reason<br/>its true the image is quit dark but if u dont see anything on your monitor than i think the monitor is no good or needs adjustement<br/>so apart from that Ennil liked the image it has some purpose in the end<br/>so sorry for the mistake im gonna try to not let it happen again<br/> <br/>greetings<br/> <br/></td>', 'sorry to have confused all you folks but this image was not meant as an entry for this challengethe xx is just a worktitle and i just parked the image there to see what it looks like (lack of space in my portofolio)this happened to me twice lately im afraid to sayi have tried to get it undone the entry but they could or would not let me do soor at least give it a title (bark: cause that is what it isand there is a user with this name i found out) but this plan didnt work out either for some reasonits true the image is quit dark but if u dont see anything on your monitor than i think the monitor is no good or needs adjustementso apart from that Ennil liked the image it has some purpose in the endso sorry for the mistake im gonna try to not let it happen again greetings ', '2006-01-02 00:59:36.000000', NULL, 0),
