(1994093, 271508, 22734, '<td valign="top">Tender and beautiful. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Tender and beautiful. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-01-02 01:01:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1994095, 271073, 47117, '<td valign="top">For those wondering, this duck is just fine. He is the biggest duck in the pond, and is like the king duck there to the other ducks. He gets fed daily and all day people come sporatically to feed them all, including my own family.  <br/> <br/>His bill isn''t completely gone. The bottom is in tact, and the top one is turned completely to one side. You just can''t see it in this photo. I can''t imagine how it happened, but I imagine it must have happened as a small baby when the bill was soft.  He can eat fine, as long as he is left alone, but when there is a lot of competition, it is best he is fed by hand.  I am sure he must get plenty of fish though, just for his pure size. You can always pick him out of the bunch.<br/> <br/>Thank you "wackybill". I am glad you are flattered!<br/> <br/>Rose</td>', 'For those wondering, this duck is just fine. He is the biggest duck in the pond, and is like the king duck there to the other ducks. He gets fed daily and all day people come sporatically to feed them all, including my own family.   His bill isn''t completely gone. The bottom is in tact, and the top one is turned completely to one side. You just can''t see it in this photo. I can''t imagine how it happened, but I imagine it must have happened as a small baby when the bill was soft.  He can eat fine, as long as he is left alone, but when there is a lot of competition, it is best he is fed by hand.  I am sure he must get plenty of fish though, just for his pure size. You can always pick him out of the bunch. Thank you "wackybill". I am glad you are flattered! Rose', '2006-01-02 01:01:43.000000', NULL, 0),
