(1994243, 271798, 3724, '<td valign="top">With a quite popular lens.....  not fast, but capable of a couple of more stops in low light with is.  It has a good range &amp; a high creative factor as shown here and also in other work I have seen with this glass..... but I see an expensive over lap, and less sharp to your sixty.  Interesting purchase good luck with it.  Silver toning is beautiful, obviously carefully made. fyi 7.</td>', 'With a quite popular lens.....  not fast, but capable of a couple of more stops in low light with is.  It has a good range & a high creative factor as shown here and also in other work I have seen with this glass..... but I see an expensive over lap, and less sharp to your sixty.  Interesting purchase good luck with it.  Silver toning is beautiful, obviously carefully made. fyi 7.', '2006-01-02 01:50:18.000000', NULL, 0),
