(1994621, 272319, 28710, '<td valign="top">I actually thought it was kinda interesting too, I noticed that there were a couple of X patterns in the bark, but I did feel that it was a bit too much of a stretch for me.<br/> <br/>You might try hitting a desat on the blue channel to get rid of the distraction on the top left.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, an interesting abstract with a bit of a gothic feel.</td>', 'I actually thought it was kinda interesting too, I noticed that there were a couple of X patterns in the bark, but I did feel that it was a bit too much of a stretch for me. You might try hitting a desat on the blue channel to get rid of the distraction on the top left. Otherwise, an interesting abstract with a bit of a gothic feel.', '2006-01-02 09:24:12.000000', NULL, 0),
