(1994681, 272530, 24073, '<td valign="top">Well TY for all the nice comments guys, and I''m glad I could make some of you laugh with the take on the name.  I am surprised not to have any critical comments, they all seem to be really good comments, but still only 68%.  Well I am flattered for my 68% anyway, and anybody who voted on the challenge knows why, there was some incredible photos out there this go round.  Congrats to those guys, and thanks to all you who voted.</td>', 'Well TY for all the nice comments guys, and I''m glad I could make some of you laugh with the take on the name.  I am surprised not to have any critical comments, they all seem to be really good comments, but still only 68%.  Well I am flattered for my 68% anyway, and anybody who voted on the challenge knows why, there was some incredible photos out there this go round.  Congrats to those guys, and thanks to all you who voted.', '2006-01-02 10:05:13.000000', NULL, 0),
