(1995577, 272097, 37792, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  Whoever she is she is great, and the photo is awesome. Heres what I really look like... I really liked your shot thanks alot!<img alt="'' . substr(''//i27.photobucket.com/albums/c193/aurorasky83/006_3A.jpg'', strrpos(''//i27.photobucket.com/albums/c193/aurorasky83/006_3A.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//i27.photobucket.com/albums/c193/aurorasky83/006_3A.jpg"/></td>', 'I really like this photo.  Whoever she is she is great, and the photo is awesome. Heres what I really look like... I really liked your shot thanks alot!', '2006-01-02 17:06:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1995763, 272097, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gothgirl83:</b></div><hr/><i> I really like this photo.  Whoever she is she is great, and the photo is awesome. Heres what I really look like... I really liked your shot thanks alot! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hi Gothgirl.<br/> <br/>I am so pleased you liked it.  I did some research into this image before I did it.  I already had bright red hair and noticed that goth wears black or dark red lipstick with light to white makeup.  Goths don''t all have jet black hair and black lipstick.  They like to keep some femininity about them.  Which is why I laughed at some of the comments about this not being goth!!  LOL!!<br/> <br/>And then I saw your photo....which just proved what I had found was right.  It is so good to meet you.  And yes, this girl is me.<br/> <br/>Judi</td>', 'Originally posted by gothgirl83: I really like this photo.  Whoever she is she is great, and the photo is awesome. Heres what I really look like... I really liked your shot thanks alot!   Hi Gothgirl. I am so pleased you liked it.  I did some research into this image before I did it.  I already had bright red hair and noticed that goth wears black or dark red lipstick with light to white makeup.  Goths don''t all have jet black hair and black lipstick.  They like to keep some femininity about them.  Which is why I laughed at some of the comments about this not being goth!!  LOL!! And then I saw your photo....which just proved what I had found was right.  It is so good to meet you.  And yes, this girl is me. Judi', '2006-01-02 17:55:02.000000', NULL, 0),
