(1996411, 271488, 14386, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for voting.  I am very thankful to Jung Min, a student for this shot.  Indeed, I was inspired by the movie "Memoirs of the Geisha" and indeed, Jung Min is not a Japanese but Korean. She was wearing blue contact lens but I have to change the color in PS.<br/> <br/>I also would like to thank SALLY, an art student, who helped me set up this shot.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for voting.  I am very thankful to Jung Min, a student for this shot.  Indeed, I was inspired by the movie "Memoirs of the Geisha" and indeed, Jung Min is not a Japanese but Korean. She was wearing blue contact lens but I have to change the color in PS. I also would like to thank SALLY, an art student, who helped me set up this shot.', '2006-01-02 21:03:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1996453, 271678, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s kind of sad that this did so poorly. I didn''t think it was totally brilliant or anything, photographically, but it scored high in my eyes for originality and a certain funky humor. I''d have expected it to finish in, say, the 50''s.<br/> <br/>But, then, I scored a 6.2 on my stare at the sun entry and that was only good for 41st, so the voters were certainly being amped-up in this challenge :-)</td>', 'It''s kind of sad that this did so poorly. I didn''t think it was totally brilliant or anything, photographically, but it scored high in my eyes for originality and a certain funky humor. I''d have expected it to finish in, say, the 50''s. But, then, I scored a 6.2 on my stare at the sun entry and that was only good for 41st, so the voters were certainly being amped-up in this challenge :-)', '2006-01-02 21:15:07.000000', NULL, 0),
