(1996826, 271678, 6519, '<td valign="top">Thanks Robert. I realize that SOME of the lousy score has to do with people not liking the photo. <br/> <br/>However, I am convinced that at least some of it is due to <br/>A) badly calibrated monitors that didn''t show enough detail and <br/>B) some people obviously not understanding the word "amoeba".<br/> <br/>And those two contributors upset me.</td>', 'Thanks Robert. I realize that SOME of the lousy score has to do with people not liking the photo.  However, I am convinced that at least some of it is due to A) badly calibrated monitors that didn''t show enough detail and B) some people obviously not understanding the word "amoeba". And those two contributors upset me.', '2006-01-02 22:39:14.000000', NULL, 0),
