(1998885, 271660, 38277, '<td valign="top">This is <i>not original at all</i>. I thought the image looked familiar...I used to have this as a background back in high school. A quick image search confirmed this is an over-photographed site. Originality aside, I can''t say I''m impressed by the technical quality either.<br/><a href="//images.google.com/images?q=%22Mesa+Arch%22&amp;hl=en" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//images.google.com/images?q=%22Mesa+Arch%22&amp;hl=en</a></td>', 'This is not original at all. I thought the image looked familiar...I used to have this as a background back in high school. A quick image search confirmed this is an over-photographed site. Originality aside, I can''t say I''m impressed by the technical quality either.//images.google.com/images?q=%22Mesa+Arch%22&hl=en', '2006-01-03 15:57:33.000000', NULL, 0),
