(1999262, 271660, 39880, '<td valign="top">Hey Brent, it''s a great shot.  The fact that you took a popular scene and made an excellent shot is something to be proud of.  I feel that''s how we learn.  We find pictures we like and see if we can do the same or better.  This is one of the best I''ve seen.  Good work.</td>', 'Hey Brent, it''s a great shot.  The fact that you took a popular scene and made an excellent shot is something to be proud of.  I feel that''s how we learn.  We find pictures we like and see if we can do the same or better.  This is one of the best I''ve seen.  Good work.', '2006-01-03 18:34:42.000000', NULL, 0),
