(2010837, 271965, 45635, '<td valign="top">hi i''m from the cc <br/>the lighting is very nice and goes very well with the theme of the contest, i think the DOF is ok though. you have a great shot here but what i''ve noticed in this site to win is creativity which alot of people have used to try and win and caused them to have a higher score. thinking outside the box is key.</td>', 'hi i''m from the cc the lighting is very nice and goes very well with the theme of the contest, i think the DOF is ok though. you have a great shot here but what i''ve noticed in this site to win is creativity which alot of people have used to try and win and caused them to have a higher score. thinking outside the box is key.', '2006-01-06 18:48:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2010856, 271282, 45635, '<td valign="top">hi i''m from the CC<br/> <br/>this image tells alot and i love that photojournalistic feel and this picture has much of it.<br/> <br/>your white balance seems a bit off, in photoshop this is easy to correct using the levels tool. the tree branches coming in from the corner are a bit distracting as well and so is the big trunk because it creates a sort of line that leads to nothing.other than that the image is great i believe.</td>', 'hi i''m from the CC this image tells alot and i love that photojournalistic feel and this picture has much of it. your white balance seems a bit off, in photoshop this is easy to correct using the levels tool. the tree branches coming in from the corner are a bit distracting as well and so is the big trunk because it creates a sort of line that leads to nothing.other than that the image is great i believe.', '2006-01-06 18:56:17.000000', NULL, 0),
