(2064954, 272613, 12611, '<td valign="top">Alternate title bold  acceptance or I will eat the rose<br/>I could be way off base but... You have a terrifically pained look on your face which shows the true anticipation of pain(perhaps a metaphor for real life anxiety); But, although a rose is sweet and symbolizes love; there can be bitterness and inevitable thorns if mistreated; or, perhaps, we must in life strive for the good true and beautiful, despite the pain, and inescapable sense that love is ephemeral, fleeting, and that along with the sweet smell there is the sometimes painful consequences. The facial grimace may not be that you are expecting to take the rose into your mouth, but that you have already squeezed and felt the thorns; in that case; the rose in the mouth is indicative of a strong will; someone who says  I can take this pain and will move on, I will not weep longingly over romantic photos in a book strewn with dried rose petals; I will eat the rose.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-25 07:56:01.</i></td>', 'Alternate title bold  acceptance or I will eat the roseI could be way off base but... You have a terrifically pained look on your face which shows the true anticipation of pain(perhaps a metaphor for real life anxiety); But, although a rose is sweet and symbolizes love; there can be bitterness and inevitable thorns if mistreated; or, perhaps, we must in life strive for the good true and beautiful, despite the pain, and inescapable sense that love is ephemeral, fleeting, and that along with the sweet smell there is the sometimes painful consequences. The facial grimace may not be that you are expecting to take the rose into your mouth, but that you have already squeezed and felt the thorns; in that case; the rose in the mouth is indicative of a strong will; someone who says  I can take this pain and will move on, I will not weep longingly over romantic photos in a book strewn with dried rose petals; I will eat the rose.', '2006-01-20 17:09:41.000000', '2006-01-25 07:56:01.000000', 0),
(2067149, 271073, 24628, '<td valign="top">Wow, yeah ~ this is a great, unexpected subject!  The composition is terrific.  There''s a kind of sad-but-hanging-on look in the eye, you know?  Very interesting and loaded with implied narrative!<br/> <br/>Very nice ~ and I agree:  underrated.<br/> <br/>~ bacchus</td>', 'Wow, yeah ~ this is a great, unexpected subject!  The composition is terrific.  There''s a kind of sad-but-hanging-on look in the eye, you know?  Very interesting and loaded with implied narrative! Very nice ~ and I agree:  underrated. ~ bacchus', '2006-01-21 09:51:44.000000', NULL, 0),
