(2143641, 272556, 53213, '<td valign="top">Barren and stark, but with the potential for life. <br/> <br/>This photo exemplifies how I feel every time I venture into your neck of the woods.<br/> <br/>My eye is drawn to the branches on the lower/left side of the tree. Focusing on just those branches brings to mind the lightening storms that fire the sky in the springtime. Awe inspiring. <br/> <br/>May I print this for my little apartment?</td>', 'Barren and stark, but with the potential for life.  This photo exemplifies how I feel every time I venture into your neck of the woods. My eye is drawn to the branches on the lower/left side of the tree. Focusing on just those branches brings to mind the lightening storms that fire the sky in the springtime. Awe inspiring.  May I print this for my little apartment?', '2006-02-11 23:02:37.000000', NULL, 0),
