(2413753, 271769, 36628, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting on this really hurt the shot. The colors look a little dull overall, I think because the lighting is just a bit harsh and also perhaps becasue of white background which sort of overpowers the image with brightness. This same shot with softer lighting on a black or gray BG would be a lot more visually impacting.</td>', 'I think the lighting on this really hurt the shot. The colors look a little dull overall, I think because the lighting is just a bit harsh and also perhaps becasue of white background which sort of overpowers the image with brightness. This same shot with softer lighting on a black or gray BG would be a lot more visually impacting.', '2006-05-14 04:53:44.000000', NULL, 0),
